      "text": "imports         = argparse, os, shutil, sys, and Path from pathlib\n\nSKILLS_SRC      = the \"skill\" folder next to this file\nDESTINATIONS    = three install roots by label: claude, droid, shared\n\n_supports_color = does this terminal accept color codes?    (_supports_color)\n_COLOR          = the answer, found once at import time    (_supports_color)\nRED, GREEN, YELLOW, RESET = the color codes, or empty strings when _COLOR is false\n\navailable_skills = the sorted names of the skill folders in SKILLS_SRC    (available_skills)\ninstalled_skills = the sorted names of the skill folders found in any destination root    (installed_skills)\ndeploy_skill     = copy one skill from SKILLS_SRC into each destination, replace what is there    (deploy_skill)\ndiff_skill       = for each destination, list the files that are new, removed, or modified against SKILLS_SRC    (diff_skill)\nremove_skills    = delete the named skills from each destination that has them    (remove_skills)\nmain             = read the command flags and run list, diff, remove, or deploy    (main)\n\nentry point     = when run as a script, call main    (main)",
